-service-management/universal-request-for-hr-service-delivery/using-ur.md","line":46},{"title":"Better together solution: Legal Investigations and HR Service Delivery Employee Relations","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/employee-service-management/legal-investigations/lsd-investigations-hr-emp-relations.md","line":48},{"title":"Configure Universal Request for legal services","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/employee-service-management/legal-service-delivery/configure-universal-request-legal.md","line":58},{"title":"Configure Universal Request for legal services","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/employee-service-management/legal-service-delivery/configure-universal-request-legal.md","line":60},{"title":"Create a legal request from a universal request","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/employee-service-management/legal-service-delivery/create-legal-request-universal-request.md","line":62},{"title":"Create a legal request from a universal request","target":"create-legal-request-universal-request","line":63},{"title":"Transfer a legal ticket to another department","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/employee-service-management/legal-service-delivery/transfer-legal-request-universal-request.md","line":64},{"title":"Integration of Legal Service Delivery with ServiceNow applications","target":"https://raw.githubusercontent.com/ServiceNow/ServiceNowDocs/australia/markdown/employee-service-management/legal-service-delivery/snclc-integrate-lsd-lp.md","line":67},{"title":"Universal Request","target":"ur-landing-limitedaccess","line":71},{"title":"Legal Service Delivery","target":"legal-management-overview","line":72},{"title":"Legal Request Management","target":"legal-request-management-landing-page","line